//  - Star of David: two equilateral triangles about one centre (225.7, 260.5),
//    circumradius 253.7, each a ring of constant band width 41.6; the darker
//    faces are bounded by the bands' miter lines.
//  - Arrow: an equilateral head (side 214.27) on a straight shaft along a
//    50.54° axis that sweeps into two G1-joined cubic Béziers; the right
//    half (axis to edge) is the darker face.
//  - A 20-unit white clearance separates the star from the arrow and the arch,
//    so the emblem works on any background.
//  - The arch keeps the contour traced from the official app icon.
